To ace the technical interview at Reap, you should focus on core data structures, array manipulations, and string processing. Past candidate reports indicate that the problems generally range from LeetCode Easy to Medium, with a strong emphasis on clean code, edge-case handling, and optimal time complexity.
Here are three distinct problem types you are highly likely to encounter, along with their solutions and analytical breakdowns.
